msgstr "Alla prestationer kom inte tillbaka; resten visas som de senast hämtades."

#: crates/caskade-core/src/achievements/retroachievements/mod.rs
msgid "RetroAchievements user name"
msgstr "Användarnamn hos RetroAchievements"

#: crates/caskade-core/src/achievements/retroachievements/mod.rs
msgid "Web API key"
msgstr "Webb-API-nyckel"

#: crates/caskade-core/src/achievements/retroachievements/mod.rs
msgid "From the Keys section of your RetroAchievements settings."
msgstr "Från avsnittet Nycklar i dina RetroAchievements-inställningar."

#: crates/caskade-core/src/achievements/retroachievements/mod.rs
msgid "Caskade reads your progress only. Achievements are earned in an emulator core that supports RetroAchievements, signed in there."
msgstr "Caskade läser bara dina framsteg. Prestationer tjänas in i en emulatorkärna som stöder RetroAchievements och är inloggad där."

